sequenceDiagram
 participant U as User
 participant O as Orchestrator
 participant K as Knowledge
 participant A as Specialist Agent
 participant H as Human Approver
 participant C as Canonical API
 U->>O: Submit task
 O->>K: Retrieve authorized context
 O->>A: Assign scoped work
 A-->>O: Recommendation + confidence + citations
 O->>H: Request approval when required
 H-->>O: Approve or reject
 O->>C: Execute approved writeback
 O-->>U: Return result and audit reference
